flowchart LR
    czi[(One shared CZI file)] --> queue[Field job queue]
    queue --> worker1[Worker 1]
    queue --> worker2[Worker 2]
    queue --> worker3[Worker 3]
    queue --> worker4[Worker 4]

    subgraph active[At most max_workers active fields]
        worker1 --> graph1[Lazy field graph and active chunks]
        worker2 --> graph2[Lazy field graph and active chunks]
        worker3 --> graph3[Lazy field graph and active chunks]
        worker4 --> graph4[Lazy field graph and active chunks]
    end

    graph1 --> store[(Sharded Zarr v3 plate)]
    graph2 --> store
    graph3 --> store
    graph4 --> store

    metadata[Shared parsed metadata] -. shallow per-read copy .-> graph1
    metadata -. shallow per-read copy .-> graph2
    metadata -. shallow per-read copy .-> graph3
    metadata -. shallow per-read copy .-> graph4

    note[The complete plate is never materialized in RAM]
    active --- note